{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucy is a cheerful and confident girl who excels in star magic. Since childhood, she has dreamed of becoming a world-renowned grand mage. Both in daily life and magical studies, Lucy works diligently, filling her notebooks with magical theories. She prided herself on her magical talents until she encountered Jeruf's Super Magic Book. To her astonishment, the magic she cast differed completely from the book's descriptions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the Super Magic Book\u00a0flawed? Was it exaggerated? Who exactly is the legendary Grand Mage Jeruf?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind this magical scripture? Does the demon sealed by Jeruf truly exist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Lucy in uncovering the truth hidden behind the Super Magic Book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480620/extras/2d8aca98618587c519f36077b4bec02d.avif?t=1773707071\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480620/extras/ef4fedfa37340d29f3c8b85daa71339d.avif?t=1773707071\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2D side-scrolling action-adventure with simple yet engaging gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480620/extras/a155a92297ea8dc471d3c85c9a2533ed.poster.avif?t=1773707071\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480620/extras/a155a92297ea8dc471d3c85c9a2533ed.webm?t=1773707071\" type=\"vid